<title>USA: N.Y. State Dorm Auth, yields 5.90 pct in 2021.</title>
<headline>N.Y. State Dorm Auth, yields 5.90 pct in 2021.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>M.R. Beal &amp; Co said it repriced $20.600 million of New York State Dormitory Authority revenue bonds, Series 1996 with a top yield of 5.90 percent in 2021.</p>
</text>
